  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **How To Embrace A Swamp Creature**: rare: 11 archived performances [6]\n- **Going To Bolivia**: back after 48 archived shows (1052 days); rare: 13 archived performances [6]\n- **I Know You've Come To Take My Toys Away**: back after 247 archived shows (8063 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [6]\n- **Chanson Du Bon Chose**: rare: 11 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2018-04-13** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 95 min; rated 5/5 by 4 [1]. Said about its sound: Stage speech was inaudible in the back, but clear in this recording; Recording captures the audience singing along beautifully; Crowd energy is palpable, showcasing Peter Hughes effectively [3][4][5]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Banter-No Children, Banter-See America Right, Banter-Shelved [1]\n- Listener stood near Emerald and Kyle, crying while giving John lyrics [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2018-04-13**: taped by LMGBTapes; transferred by LMGBTapes; source: Zoom H4n Pro Onboard Mics > Audacity (Bass reduction, Amplify) > Flac level 8 [1]. Also: Uploader lists the setlist order and associated album sources [1]",
